  "description": "Reads Rich Text Format (RTF 1.9) into a DocWright Word document and writes a Word document as RTF, with no third-party dependencies. Formatting, fonts, colours, tables (nested included), sections, pictures and styles are imported; the single-byte code pages are compiled in, so a file decodes to the same text on every runtime with no encoding provider to register. The writer is deterministic and escapes any character its code page cannot hold. Most users should install the DocWright package instead, which includes this one.",
